case "$ver" in *"LLVM version 16"*) note "klee built against LLVM 16" "PASS" ;; *) note "klee built against LLVM 16" "FAIL"; fail=1 ;; esac
check "llvm-config-16 version" "$(llvm-config-16 --version)" "16.0.6"

cd "$tmp" || exit 1
cat > prog.c <<'EOF'
#include <klee/klee.h>
#include <assert.h>

int main(void) {
  int a, b;
  klee_make_symbolic(&a, sizeof(a), "a");
  klee_make_symbolic(&b, sizeof(b), "b");
  if (a < 0) {
    if (b == a * 2) {
      if (a == -5 && b == -10) klee_assert(0); /* reachable -> must be found */
    }
  }
  return 0;
}
EOF
